# Secure Industrial Loading Gate

## COMP50069 - Hardware, Microcontrollers and Sensors

This project implements a Secure Industrial Loading Gate using an ESP32.

## Components
- ESP32
- PIR Sensor
- HC-SR04 Ultrasonic Sensor
- Potentiometer
- Servo Motor
- I2C OLED Display
- Buzzer
- Push Button

## Main Features
- Automatic vehicle detection
- Vehicle confirmation within 15 cm
- Automatic gate opening and closing
- Vehicle presence monitoring
- Adjustable 2-8 second hold-open time
- Obstruction safety detection
- Buzzer warning
- OLED status display
- Automatic and Manual modes
- UART Serial Monitor control

## UART Commands
- A - Automatic Mode
- M - Manual Mode
- O - Open Gate
- C - Close Gate

## Safety System
If an obstruction is detected within 20 cm while the gate is closing,
the gate stops and the buzzer is activated. After the obstruction is
removed, the reset button can be used to reopen the gate.
